{% comment %}
界栏 jielan：日志的逐条记录。左上标题（宋体 200、title 档，标题前一个鱼尾）；右边逐行横排：行首壹贰叁（楷书 ink-3），步骤名（宋体 600、lead），注释（body ink-2，等宽数字）同一行靠右，每行一条 rule-light 界栏，像一页对齐的记录。
朱色：无。入场：标题升起，各行自上而下错峰 line。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: var(--ds-space-7) var(--ds-space-7);
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
    text-spacing-trim: trim-both;
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  p, h1, h2, ol, ul, li, figure, figcaption, blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  p, li, blockquote { text-wrap: pretty; }
  h1, h2 { text-wrap: balance; }

  .page {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4fr 9fr;
    column-gap: var(--ds-space-8);
    height: 100%;
  }
  .head { padding-top: var(--ds-space-5); }
  .yuwei { display: block; width: 32px; margin-bottom: var(--ds-space-4); fill: var(--ds-color-ink); }
  .heading {
    font-family: var(--ds-font-cjk);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-title);
    font-weight: 200;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .rows { align-self: center; list-style: none; counter-reset: n; border-top: 2px solid var(--ds-color-ink); }
  .rows li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6em 6.2em 1fr;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: var(--ds-space-3) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule-light);
    counter-increment: n;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-lead);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .rows li::before {
    content: counter(n, simp-chinese-formal);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-kai);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-note);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-3);
  }
  .name { font-family: var(--ds-font-cjk); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .note { font-size: var(--ds-type-body); color: var(--ds-color-ink-2); font-feature-settings: "lnum" 1, "tnum" 1; }
</style>
<div class="page">
  <div class="head" data-ds-enter="rise" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="1"><svg class="yuwei" viewBox="0 0 24 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0H24V10L17 5.5L12 11.5L7 5.5L0 10Z"/></svg><h1 class="heading">{{ slots.heading }}</h1></div>
  <ol class="rows" data-ds-stagger="line">
    {% for s in slots.steps %}<li data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="{{ forloop.index | plus: 1 }}"><span class="name">{{ s }}</span><span class="note">{{ slots.stepNotes[forloop.index0] }}</span></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</div>
